From 6e132ceab6a19160cedfafad4748c96e9330f70b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Damodar Reddy GangiReddy <dgangire@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Nov 2025 12:32:10 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Scan Optimization for Specific Scan Channel

App, Framework, Stack changes are included to send
Vendor specific command or HCI Command for specific Scan Channel.

New Parameter scanChannel is added to ScanSettings.java to handle
specific Scan Channel.
Added specific_scan_channel flag.
LeExtendedScanChannelParams Interface is added in pdl.

As Advertisers can advertise only in selected primary channels
(37,38,39)

Optimization in scanning is done. To Scan only in specified
scan channel.

Change-Id: Ia39f1d74ed16fe681d3cc0ef7a85110d87e3ff37
